WEBVTT

scene1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.900
Tomorrow, Gunter has an appointment.

scene2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:08.100
Today, he takes things a little easier.

scene3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.350
His appointment and shopping list are already here.

scene4
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.850
Then a small suggestion.

scene5
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.300
Maybe Noor could help with the groceries?

scene6
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.300
He reads the draft, and makes it his own.

scene7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.300
Nothing goes out without his say.

scene8
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.750
When he's ready, he sends it.

scene9
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.650
A little more room to enjoy his own morning.
